"Hello {member_name},\n"
"\n"
"We've moved {society_name} to a brand-new website. Your membership and all of your information came with us — but for your security, your old password did not.\n"
"\n"
"To sign in for the first time, please set up a new password. It only takes a moment:\n"
"\n"
"{setup_link}\n"
"\n"
"If you weren't expecting this email, you can safely ignore it.\n"
"\n"
"Warm regards,\n"
"{society_name}"
