"\n"
"If an account matching \"{username}\" is in our records, we've just emailed a one-time link to the email address we have on file for you. Please check your inbox in a few minutes (and your spam or junk folder, just in case).\n"
"\n"
"We'll only ask you to do this once."
msgstr ""

